@startuml
title UC-012 Manage the navigations from outside Moodle
start
:The integration calls a function with its token;
if (Does the user of the token hold the capability?) then (yes)
  if (Is the call valid?) then (yes)
    :Apply the change, or return the data asked for;
  else (no)
    :Raise an exception that names the fields;
  endif
else (no)
  :Raise an exception for the capability;
endif
stop
@enduml
